mmand's RunE lazy load (each command execution reads `config.runtime` instantiates piRuntime/piEnv/pibuilder injects handler, task6/7落地) — **forbidden to LoadConfig in NewRootCmd/NewXxxCmd construction** (triggers `~/.rick/config.json` write side effect, breaks `--help`/`--version`/tests).\n\nNow the key subtlety: this task is \"只做包迁移 + session 就绪判定显式化\" - only do package migration + explicit session readiness determination. Don't change Execute signature, don't delete internal/agent interface, don't delete internal/actpath. Those are for task8.\n\nSo the key work is:\n1. Create `internal/runtime` package by moving the piagent files (cli.go, executor.go, agentdir.go) into it, changing package name from `piagent` to `runtime`.\n2. Keep the `internal/agent` interface and have `internal/runtime` implement AgentExecutor/AgentSession.\n3. Extract `isSessionReady` function + unit test.\n4. Change all imports of `internal/agent/piagent` to `internal/runtime` in cmd files. But wait — the files in cmd use `piagent.CallCLI`, `piagent.ModeInteractive`, `piagent.ModePrint`, `piagent.FindBinary`, `piagent.NewExecutor`, `piagent.AgentDir`, `piagent.SettingsPath`, `piagent.RuntimeDir`, `piagent.RuntimeBin`, `piagent.FileExists`, `piagent.EnsureAgentDir`, `piagent.AgentEnv`. If I move to `internal/runtime`, I need to update the import path AND the package qualifier (from `piagent.` to `runtime.`).\n\nActually the task says: \"所有 `internal/agent/piagent` import 改为 `internal/runtime`\". So change the import path. And the qualifier becomes `runtime.` (since package name would be `runtime`). Wait, but there's a conflict: `internal/executor` package imports `runtime`? No. But `runtime` is also the Go standard library `runtime` package name. Hmm. Within `internal/cmd`, do they import stdlib `runtime`? Let me check. Probably not. But it's a naming concern. The task explicitly says create `internal/runtime` package. The package name should be `runtime`. Let me use package name `runtime`.\n\nActually wait, let me reconsider. The task says `internal/runtime` (pi 调用封装). And references `piRuntime`, `Runtime` interface. The package name is `runtime`. The struct `piRuntime` implements `Runtime` interface.\n\nSo the plan:\n\n**Step A: Create `internal/runtime` package**\n\nMove:\n- `internal/agent/piagent/cli.go` → `internal/runtime/cli.go` (package runtime)\n- `internal/agent/piagent/executor.go` → `internal/runtime/executor.go` (package runtime)\n- `internal/agent/piagent/agentdir.go` → `internal/runtime/agentdir.go` (package runtime)\n\nPlus new files:\n- `internal/runtime/runtime.go` — `Runtime` interface, `piRuntime` skeleton, `Trace` struct, `Run` method.\n\n**Step B: Update imports in cmd files**\n\nAll `\"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/agent/piagent\"` → `\"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/runtime\"` and `piagent.` → `runtime.`.\n\n**Step C: Extract isSessionReady**\n\nIn executor.go, add:\n```go\nfunc isSessionReady(sessionID string, settled bool) bool {\n    return sessionID != \"\" && settled\n}\n```\n\nWait, but where to put it? Task says \"抽出「sessionID 非空 && settled」的判定函数并补单测\". Add `isSessionReady` function. And unit test with fake JSONL (with/without agent_settled). The test should call `isSessionReady` and check. But also the test says \"另 `TestLoadConfig_RuntimeDefault`：空 config → cfg.Runtime == \"pi\"（归一化）\".\n\nActually, let me re-read the test method section carefully:\n\n\"边界（session 就绪判定 + config 默认值）：前置条件 = 用 fake pi 输出一段含 `{\"type\":\"session\",\"id\":\"s123\"}` + `{\"type\":\"agent_settled\"}` 的 JSONL；输入 = 该 JSONL；操作 = 调 `isSessionReady` 检查返回；预期 = 有 `agent_settled` 返回 true；去掉 `agent_settled` 返回 false（本 task 不改变 Execute 不报错行为）。另 `TestLoadConfig_RuntimeDefault`：空 config → `cfg.Runtime == \"pi\"`（归一化）。\"\n\nSo `isSessionReady` takes sessionID and settled (or the session struct). Let me design it to be testable directly. Options:\n```go\nfunc isSessionReady(sessionID string, settled bool) bool {\n    return sessionID != \"\" && settle