return sessionID != \"\" && settled\n}\n```\n\nAnd the test can do both: parse JSONL then call `isSessionReady(sess.sessionID, sess.settled)`. This satisfies \"fake JSONL\" and \"调 isSessionReady\".\n\nActually, let me make it take the session struct for cleaner semantics? No — explicit params are more unit-testable and match \"sessionID 非空 && settled\". I'll go with (sessionID string, settled bool).\n\nLet me write test:\n```go\nfunc TestIsSessionReady(t *testing.T) {\n    withSettled := `{\"type\":\"session\",\"id\":\"s123\"}\n{\"type\":\"agent_settled\"}\n`\n    sess := mustParse(t, withSettled)\n    if !isSessionReady(sess.sessionID, sess.settled) {\n        t.Error(\"expected ready=true with session id + agent_settled\")\n    }\n\n    noSettled := `{\"type\":\"session\",\"id\":\"s123\"}\n`\n    sess = mustParse(t, noSettled)\n    if isSessionReady(sess.sessionID, sess.settled) {\n        t.Error(\"expected ready=false without agent_settled\")\n    }\n}\n```\n\nThis matches \"有 agent_settled 返回 true；去掉 agent_settled 返回 false\".\n\n**Step D: config `runtime` field**\n\nAdd `Runtime string \\`json:\"runtime\"\\`` to Config struct. Default \"pi\". Normalize in LoadConfig: if cfg.Runtime == \"\" → \"pi\". Add to GetDefaultConfig: Runtime: \"pi\".\n\nWait, the task says:\n\"「`runtime` 空值 → `\"pi\"`」归一化落在 `LoadConfig`（`json.Unmarshal` 不回填默认值，补单测），**并同步在 `GetDefaultConfig()` 加 `Runtime:\"pi\"`（覆盖「无 config 文件」分支）**\"\n\nSo:\n- `GetDefaultConfig()` sets `Runtime: \"pi\"`.\n- `LoadConfig()` after `json.Unmarshal`, normalize empty → \"pi\".\n\nAdd test `TestLoadConfig_RuntimeDefault`: empty config → cfg.Runtime == \"pi\".\n\n**Step E: Runtime interface + piRuntime skeleton + Trace struct**\n\nCreate `internal/runtime/runtime.go`:\n\n```go\npackage runtime\n\nimport (\n    \"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/config\"\n    \"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/agent\"\n)\n\n// Trace carries the behavioral trace of a single runtime run.\ntype Trace struct {\n    SessionID    string\n    ToolCalls    []agent.ToolCall\n    FinalMessage string\n    RawLogPath   string\n    Duration     time.Duration\n    Settled      bool\n}\n\n// Runtime is the seam for agent runtimes (pi today, dsh later). Handlers depend\n// on this interface rather than a concrete piRuntime, so adding a new runtime\n// means implementing and registering dshRuntime without touching handlers.\ntype Runtime interface {\n    Name() string\n    Run(methodText string, promptFile string, cfg *config.Config) (sessionID string, trace *Trace, err error)\n}\n\n// piRuntime implements Runtime for the pi coding agent.\ntype piRuntime struct {\n    // ...\n}\n\nfunc (r *piRuntime) Name() string { return \"pi\" }\n\nfunc (r *piRuntime) Run(methodText string, promptFile string, cfg *config.Config) (string, *Trace, error) {\n    // skeleton for now; final signature lands with task8's Execute→Run switch.\n    // methodText -> temp file -> --append-system-prompt <file>; promptFile -> user prompt.\n    ...\n}\n```\n\nNow, the `Run` method needs to actually launch pi with methodText written to temp file and injected via `--append-system-prompt <methodFile>`, promptFile as user prompt. And `CallCLI` also supports `--append-system-prompt <methodFile>` via extraArgs.\n\nWait, let me carefully re-read key result 6:\n\n\"6. 定义 `Runtime` 接口（`Name`/`Run(methodText, promptFile, cfg)`）+ `piRuntime` 骨架 + config `runtime` 字段（默认 `\"pi\"`）+ `Trace` 结构体（sessionID/toolCalls/finalMessage/rawLogPath/duration/settled，等价承载原 act-path + session 信息）；`Run` 启动 pi 时把 `methodText` **落盘临时文件、经 `--append-system-prompt <method文件路径>` 注入**（会话前注入系统提示词，保留 pi 默认骨架，避免长文本 inline 传参；**临时文件由 runtime 创建并 `defer` 清理、用完即删**），`promptFile` 作为 user prompt；**`CallCLI` 同样经 extraArgs 支持 `--append-system-prompt <methodFile>` 注入（交互命令 plan/easy/human-loop/ctrl 也注入 method）**；handler 依赖 `Runtime` 接口，组合根按 config 选实现（dsh 扩展位）；「`runtime` 空值 → `\"pi\"`」归一化落在 `LoadConfig`（`json.Unmarshal` 不回填默认值，补单测），**并同步在 `GetDefaultConfig()` 加 `Runtime:\"pi\"`（覆盖「